(## 4. API Reference Specifications) '
() '
(All API endpoints are mounted under the base URL `/api/v1` and accept/return JSON pay) '
(  loads.) '
() '
(### 4.1 Authentication \(`/api/v1/auth`\)) '
(| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth Required |) '
(| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |) '
(| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/login` | Authenticate with work email & password | None |) '
(| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/demo-login` | 1-click persona login \(`role` or `email`\) | No) '
(  ne |) '
(| `GET` | `/api/v1/auth/me` | Fetch active user credentials and employee profile | Be) '
(  arer Token |) '
(| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/logout` | Invalidate active user session | Bearer Token |) '
() '
