(## 7. Security Architecture) '
(- **Cryptographic Hashing**: All seeded and user passwords are encrypted with `bcrypt) '
(  js` salt rounds.) '
(- **JWT Authentication**: Bearer tokens are signed with cryptographic secrets and val) '
(  idated on every protected API endpoint.) '
